    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιττῠβίζω</span></b> , prop. of the cry of the common
		partridge, distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακκαβίζω</span> (of
		the Greek partridge), <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			181
		</span></i>: generally, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίζω</span>
			, of swallows and other small birds, <i>twitter, chirrup</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				131.7
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. κέλαδον παντομιγῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
					7.5
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιτιττυβίζω</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
